| Scenario | Callouts in one transaction | Extra jobs |
|---|---|---|
| 1 account (user) | 1 | none |
| 200 accounts (marketplace) | 100 | one more Queueable with 100 |

Each POST body is a JSON array with exactly one customer object, matching the "one request per new account" requirement so the ERP side can attribute every call to a single `salesforceId`.

